  "Description": "PinPath enables flexible visualization of (omics) data\nonto pathways diagrams, allowing users to pinpoint where the\nrelevant changes occur. It supports pathway diagrams from\nWikiPathways and KEGG, as well as custom GPML and KGML files.\nData can be displayed on both native pathway layouts and\nnetwork representations.",
